20 nm center wavelength, a microscope lens (Leica HCX PL APO 100x/1.4-0.7 Oil CS) for beam focussing in oil-immersion mode, and an acousto-optic modulator (AA MT80-A1.5-IR) were utilized. The resists were prepared by add- ing 7-diethylamino-3-thenoylcoumarin (DETC; 30 mmol), dibu- tylamine (DBA; 7.5 mmol, 15 mmol, 30 mmol, 60 mmol, and 120 mmol), or diphenyliodonium hexa uorophosphate (DPIHFP, 15.6 mmol, 31.2 mmol, and 62.4 mmol), respectively, to pentaer- ythritol triacrylate (PETA; 2 g) in a vial under consta...",,,,context_candidate,machine_numeric_extraction,machine_high,auto_provisional_accept,automatic_context_candidate,two_photon_numeric_extraction,CAND-0000089,,context candidate has wavelength and resin signal; equality across all PIs still needs audit,series context candidate; matched-series equality still requires audit
