zotero_TN4FRK7S:pi_loading:5,zotero_TN4FRK7S,TN4FRK7S,10.1080/15685551.2015.1092008,Synthesis of new photoactive urethane carbohydrates and their behavior in UV or femtosecond laser-induced two-photon polymerization,pi_loading,,,,,12,"free-standing grid structures prepared from all formulations (B1–B3) are without defects. hence, our new glycomonomers (CMA-1–3) could be applied in the fabrication of well-structured films by the 2PP technique for laser power values of 10 mW, working at 1 mm s −1 scanning speed and using Irg819 as photoinitiator. From this perspec- tive, the 2PP method is ideal for the production of a series of identical structures, with defined dimensions between the polymerized lines, and if the materials processed through this technique are biocompatible and biodegradable, finally will lead to scaffolds with a well-controlled porosity and preset size of the pores. 4. Conclusio","free-standing grid structures prepared from all formulations (B1–B3) are without defects. hence, our new glycomonomers (CMA-1–3) could be applied in the fabrication of well-structured films by the 2PP technique for laser power values of 10 mW, working at 1 mm s −1 scanning speed and using Irg819 as photoinitiator. From this perspec- tive, the 2PP method is ideal for the production of a series of identical structures, with defined dimensions between the polymerized lines, and if the materials processed through this technique are biocompatible and biodegradable, finally will lead to scaffolds with a well-controlled porosity and preset size of the pores. 4. Conclusio",,,,anchor_candidate,machine_text_anchor,text_exact_candidate,auto_anchor_candidate,automatic_field_discovery,anchor_mining,zotero_TN4FRK7S:pi_loading:5,outputs/zotero_tpp_literature_pilot_20260828/parsed_local_pdfs/texts/zotero_TN4FRK7S_10.1080_15685551.2015.1092008.txt,Keyword/field anchor mined from parsed full text; value extraction was not independently asserted.,pending
