zotero_XAY2YYCX:sigma2:6,zotero_XAY2YYCX,XAY2YYCX,10.1021/ma9007785,Structure-activity relationship in d-π-a-π-d-based photoinitiators for the two-photon-induced photopolymerization process,sigma_2pa,,,,,2,"e-bond-containing 1,5- bis(4-(N,N-dimethylamino)phenyl)penta-1,4-diyn-3-one (M3K) serves as a highly sensitive and efficient TPA PI at low initiator concentrations in comparison to typical one-photon UV PIs, 20 although a rather low TPA cross section below 40 GM has been calculated for this compound very recently. 33 Investigations on the single-photon photochemistry of the unsubstituted H3K showed efficient hydrogen abstraction from H-donors like iso- propyl alcohol.34,35 In the presence of monomers [2þ 2] cycload- dition between the ketone of the initiator and the double bond of a nonpolymerizable monomer has been found in acetonitrile.34 Therefore, the aim of this paper","e-bond-containing 1,5- bis(4-(N,N-dimethylamino)phenyl)penta-1,4-diyn-3-one (M3K) serves as a highly sensitive and efficient TPA PI at low initiator concentrations in comparison to typical one-photon UV PIs, 20 although a rather low TPA cross section below 40 GM has been calculated for this compound very recently. 33 Investigations on the single-photon photochemistry of the unsubstituted H3K showed efficient hydrogen abstraction from H-donors like iso- propyl alcohol.34,35 In the presence of monomers [2þ 2] cycload- dition between the ketone of the initiator and the double bond of a nonpolymerizable monomer has been found in acetonitrile.34 Therefore, the aim of this paper",,,,anchor_candidate,machine_text_anchor,text_exact_candidate,auto_anchor_candidate,automatic_field_discovery,anchor_mining,zotero_XAY2YYCX:sigma2:6,outputs/zotero_tpp_literature_pilot_20260828/parsed_local_pdfs/texts/zotero_XAY2YYCX_10.1021_ma9007785.txt,Keyword/field anchor mined from parsed full text; value extraction was not independently asserted.,pending
