zotero_ZI5SFNAQ:pi_loading:20,zotero_ZI5SFNAQ,ZI5SFNAQ,10.1002/adom.202200474,Photoinitiator-free two-photon polymerization of biocompatible materials for 3D micro/nanofabrication,pi_loading,,,,,24,"plate. MS spectrum was acquired with a MALDI-TOF MS system in positive ion mode (JMS- S3000 SpiralTOFTM-plus2.0, JEOL Ltd.). Enzymatic degradation of collagen Collagenase (FUJIFILM Wako Pure Chemical Corporation) was dissolved in PBS at a concentration of 0.8 mg/mL. The collagen solution warmed to 37 °C was dropped onto collagen microcubes with a side of 5 µm. We observed the enzymatic degradation of the microcubes with time-lapse optical bright-field imaging using the same objective lens as used for DUV-TPP fabrication. We plotted the changes in image contrast by enzymatic degradation, calculated by subtracting the light intensity on the microcubes from that around the m","plate. MS spectrum was acquired with a MALDI-TOF MS system in positive ion mode (JMS- S3000 SpiralTOFTM-plus2.0, JEOL Ltd.). Enzymatic degradation of collagen Collagenase (FUJIFILM Wako Pure Chemical Corporation) was dissolved in PBS at a concentration of 0.8 mg/mL. The collagen solution warmed to 37 °C was dropped onto collagen microcubes with a side of 5 µm. We observed the enzymatic degradation of the microcubes with time-lapse optical bright-field imaging using the same objective lens as used for DUV-TPP fabrication. We plotted the changes in image contrast by enzymatic degradation, calculated by subtracting the light intensity on the microcubes from that around the m",,,,anchor_candidate,machine_text_anchor,text_exact_candidate,auto_anchor_candidate,automatic_field_discovery,anchor_mining,zotero_ZI5SFNAQ:pi_loading:20,outputs/zotero_tpp_literature_pilot_20260828/parsed_local_pdfs/texts/zotero_ZI5SFNAQ_10.1002_adom.202200474.txt,Keyword/field anchor mined from parsed full text; value extraction was not independently asserted.,pending
